
mtah2027 pipeline container. The repo is mounted at /workspace; edits on either side show up on both.
One Python environment, no virtualenv: `python` is it (.venv/bin/python and ~/pathcrf/.venv/bin/python point to it).

  dfl-cache                       DFL open data -> data_raw/external/dfl_*.npz (once)
  python src/seq.py --cv          BiGRU leave-one-match-out on DFL
  python src/seq.py               BiGRU on BAR-ATH -> evaluation/results/seq.csv
  bash pod/pathcrf_setup.sh       PathCRF + soft team vote on BAR-ATH (run `gh auth login` once first)

Long runs: start them in tmux (`tmux new -s cv`, detach with Ctrl-b d) so they survive logging out.
More in docker/README.md.

